{"id":"884fb16496d08ed1","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus.md","title":"简单类型 λ 演算","display":"df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus — 简单类型 λ 演算","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","depends_on":["[[56-df-lambda-term]]"],"display":"df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus — 简单类型 λ 演算","label":"56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus","aliases":["56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus"],"type":"definition","source_reference":"Terese (2003), Definitions 11.2.1,11.2.5,11.2.7; arrow-only fragment of §10.5, printed pp590–592","source_ocr_block":"611–613","source_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d547d7414660f6bd\" href=\"?note=d547d7414660f6bd\" title=\"56-df-lambda-term\">56-df-lambda-term</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus — 简单类型 λ 演算"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Definitions 11.2.1,11.2.5,11.2.7; arrow-only fragment of §10.5, printed pp590–592"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"611–613"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>给定非空基本类型集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span>，类型构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow\">\\(\\Rightarrow\\)</span> 为自由二元构造子：其值与基本类型不交，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\Rightarrow B=A&#39;\\Rightarrow B&#39;\\iff(A=A&#39;\\land B=B&#39;)\">\\(A\\Rightarrow B=A&#39;\\Rightarrow B&#39;\\iff(A=A&#39;\\land B=B&#39;)\\)</span>。对每个简单类型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 给定两两不交的可数无限变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_A\">\\(V_A\\)</span>，并固定其无重复枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(v_{A,n})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((v_{A,n})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span>；设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\bigcup_A V_A\">\\(V=\\bigcup_A V_A\\)</span>，常元集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 不交，常元类型函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_F:F\\to\\mathrm{Typ}\">\\(\\tau_F:F\\to\\mathrm{Typ}\\)</span>，变量类型函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_V(x)=A\">\\(\\tau_V(x)=A\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V_A\">\\(x\\in V_A\\)</span>）。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_0=\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)\">\\(L_0=\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d547d7414660f6bd\" href=\"?note=d547d7414660f6bd\" title=\"56-df-lambda-term\">56-df-lambda-term</a> 的有限原始项集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in L_0\">\\(M,N\\in L_0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Typ}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Typ}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 是有限的同类型变量环境。此处采用仅含箭头的片段，不引入积类型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Typ}_0\\coloneqq\\mathcal B,\\qquad\\mathrm{Typ}_{n+1}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Typ}_n\\cup\\{A\\Rightarrow B:A,B\\in\\mathrm{Typ}_n\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Typ}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{Typ}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Typ}_0\\coloneqq\\mathcal B,\\qquad\\mathrm{Typ}_{n+1}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Typ}_n\\cup\\{A\\Rightarrow B:A,B\\in\\mathrm{Typ}_n\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Typ}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{Typ}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Env}\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma:\\Gamma\\subseteq\\{(x,\\tau_V(x)):x\\in V\\},\\ |\\Gamma|&lt;\\aleph_0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Env}\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma:\\Gamma\\subseteq\\{(x,\\tau_V(x)):x\\in V\\},\\ |\\Gamma|&lt;\\aleph_0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"J_0\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,x,A):\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Env},(x,A)\\in\\Gamma\\}\\cup\\{(\\Gamma,f,\\tau_F(f)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Env},f\\in F\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[J_0\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,x,A):\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Env},(x,A)\\in\\Gamma\\}\\cup\\{(\\Gamma,f,\\tau_F(f)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Env},f\\in F\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"J_{n+1}\\coloneqq J_n\\cup\\{(\\Gamma,MN,B):\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Env},\\ M,N\\in L_0,\\ B\\in\\mathrm{Typ},\\ \\exists A\\in\\mathrm{Typ}\\;((\\Gamma,M,A\\Rightarrow B)\\in J_n\\land(\\Gamma,N,A)\\in J_n)\\}\\cup\\{(\\Gamma,\\lambda x.M,A\\Rightarrow B):\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Env},\\ A,B\\in\\mathrm{Typ},\\ x\\in V_A,\\ M\\in L_0,\\ (\\Gamma\\cup\\{(x,A)\\},M,B)\\in J_n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[J_{n+1}\\coloneqq J_n\\cup\\{(\\Gamma,MN,B):\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Env},\\ M,N\\in L_0,\\ B\\in\\mathrm{Typ},\\ \\exists A\\in\\mathrm{Typ}\\;((\\Gamma,M,A\\Rightarrow B)\\in J_n\\land(\\Gamma,N,A)\\in J_n)\\}\\cup\\{(\\Gamma,\\lambda x.M,A\\Rightarrow B):\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Env},\\ A,B\\in\\mathrm{Typ},\\ x\\in V_A,\\ M\\in L_0,\\ (\\Gamma\\cup\\{(x,A)\\},M,B)\\in J_n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\Longleftrightarrow(\\Gamma,M,A)\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}J_n,\\qquad\\mathrm{Pre}_A\\coloneqq\\{M\\in L_0:\\exists\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Env}\\;(\\Gamma\\vdash M:A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\Longleftrightarrow(\\Gamma,M,A)\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}J_n,\\qquad\\mathrm{Pre}_A\\coloneqq\\{M\\in L_0:\\exists\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Env}\\;(\\Gamma\\vdash M:A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_\\tau\\coloneqq\\{(x,y)\\in V^2:\\tau_V(x)=\\tau_V(y)\\},\\qquad\\Lambda_A\\coloneqq\\{[M]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}:M\\in\\mathrm{Pre}_A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_\\tau\\coloneqq\\{(x,y)\\in V^2:\\tau_V(x)=\\tau_V(y)\\},\\qquad\\Lambda_A\\coloneqq\\{[M]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}:M\\in\\mathrm{Pre}_A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>箭头类型和带类型常元的前项直接对应原书 Definitions 11.2.1、11.2.5、11.2.7（印刷 pp590–592，OCR 页块611–613）。§10.5 还使用积类型；本节点明确只覆盖 HRS 所需的箭头片段。阶段构造使应用必须类型匹配，修复旧文中任意应用都被写入“类型项”的问题。变量类型由变量族唯一固定，环境合并不会引入异型冲突；允许同类型变量遮蔽，保证原始项在替换及 α 改名下闭合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-lambda-term","status":"resolved","id":"d547d7414660f6bd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-lambda-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-lambda-term","status":"resolved","id":"d547d7414660f6bd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"给定非空基本类型集 $\\mathcal B$，类型构造子 $\\Rightarrow$ 为自由二元构造子：其值与基本类型不交，且 $A\\Rightarrow B=A'\\Rightarrow B'\\iff(A=A'\\land B=B')$。对每个简单类型 $A$ 给定两两不交的可数无限变量集 $V_A$，并固定其无重复枚举 $(v_{A,n})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$；设 $V=\\bigcup_A V_A$，常元集 $F$ 与 $V$ 不交，常元类型函数为 $\\tau_F:F\\to\\mathrm{Typ}$，变量类型函数为 $\\tau_V(x)=A$（$x\\in V_A$）。令 $L_0=\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)$ 为 [[56-df-lambda-term]] 的有限原始项集，$M,N\\in L_0$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$A,B\\in\\mathrm{Typ}$。$\\Gamma$ 是有限的同类型变量环境。此处采用仅含箭头的片段，不引入积类型。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow","display":false},{"tex":"A\\Rightarrow B=A'\\Rightarrow B'\\iff(A=A'\\land B=B')","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"V_A","display":false},{"tex":"(v_{A,n})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"V=\\bigcup_A V_A","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_F:F\\to\\mathrm{Typ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_V(x)=A","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V_A","display":false},{"tex":"L_0=\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)","display":false},{"tex":"M,N\\in L_0","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Typ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Typ}_0\\coloneqq\\mathcal B,\\qquad\\mathrm{Typ}_{n+1}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Typ}_n\\cup\\{A\\Rightarrow B:A,B\\in\\mathrm{Typ}_n\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Typ}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{Typ}_n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Env}\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma:\\Gamma\\subseteq\\{(x,\\tau_V(x)):x\\in V\\},\\ |\\Gamma|<\\aleph_0\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"J_0\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,x,A):\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Env},(x,A)\\in\\Gamma\\}\\cup\\{(\\Gamma,f,\\tau_F(f)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Env},f\\in F\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"J_{n+1}\\coloneqq J_n\\cup\\{(\\Gamma,MN,B):\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Env},\\ M,N\\in L_0,\\ B\\in\\mathrm{Typ},\\ \\exists A\\in\\mathrm{Typ}\\;((\\Gamma,M,A\\Rightarrow B)\\in J_n\\land(\\Gamma,N,A)\\in J_n)\\}\\cup\\{(\\Gamma,\\lambda x.M,A\\Rightarrow B):\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Env},\\ A,B\\in\\mathrm{Typ},\\ x\\in V_A,\\ M\\in L_0,\\ (\\Gamma\\cup\\{(x,A)\\},M,B)\\in J_n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash M:A\\Longleftrightarrow(\\Gamma,M,A)\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}J_n,\\qquad\\mathrm{Pre}_A\\coloneqq\\{M\\in L_0:\\exists\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Env}\\;(\\Gamma\\vdash M:A)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"E_\\tau\\coloneqq\\{(x,y)\\in V^2:\\tau_V(x)=\\tau_V(y)\\},\\qquad\\Lambda_A\\coloneqq\\{[M]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}:M\\in\\mathrm{Pre}_A\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2889,"backlinks":[{"id":"5f6999282aa3dc01","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus]] 的 $\\mathrm{Typ},\\mathcal B,V_A,F,\\tau_V,\\tau_F,\\Lambda_A,E_\\tau$，令 $\\tau=\\tau_V\\cup\\tau_F$。$A,B\\in\\mathrm{Typ}$、$b\\in\\mathcal B$、$n\\in\\mathbb N$。原始项集 $L=\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)$；$H_{n,A}$ 与 $H_A^{\\mathrm{raw}}$ 是 $L$ 的子集，$H_A$ 再取同类型 α 商。$\\simeq_A$ 取 [[56-thm-typed-beta-eta-confluence]] 的固定类型 βη 转换；强正规化含固定类型惰性常元，见 [[56-thm-simply-typed-strong-normalization]]。箭头串向右结合，空输入类型串以 $b$ 为值；零参数应用以头本身为值。$W_\\lambda=\\{1,2\\}^{<\\omega}$、$\\epsilon=()$、$\\cdot$ 为串连接，$\\preceq$ 取 [[56-df-position]] 的前缀关系。$M,N,P,Q\\in L$、$x\\in V$、$h\\in V\\cup F$、$\\vec N=(N_1,\\ldots,N_k)\\in L^k$；$p\\in W_\\lambda$；子项取值仅在已量化的合法出现位置上调用。常元分支的 $f$ 仅在该分支遍历 $F$，允许 $F=\\varnothing$。"},{"id":"cb6bf2fc45691592","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $A,B\\in\\mathrm{Typ}$，$b\\in\\mathcal B$，简单类型见 [[56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus]]。函数 $\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{Ty}},\\mathrm{ord}_{\\mathrm{Ty}}:\\mathrm{Typ}\\to\\mathbb N$ 按有限类型树递归。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-295","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus.md]]"},{"id":"24bd3576f4c5852a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus]] 的仅箭头片段，$F$ 是任意与变量不交的常元集，$\\tau_F:F\\to\\mathrm{Typ}$ 固定。常元没有额外归约规则。$T_{\\mathrm{Ty}}=\\bigcup_{A\\in\\mathrm{Typ}}\\Lambda_A$，按同类型 $\\equiv_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}$ 识别。$\\to_\\beta,\\to_\\eta$ 是 [[56-df-beta-reduction]] 的商上收缩关系，包含全部应用及抽象上下文。$\\mathrm{SN}$ 是 [[56-df-strongly-normalizing]] 的关系参数化谓词。"},{"id":"d344b982e3ec8df3","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus]] 的任意基本类型集和固定类型常元 $F$，常元没有额外规则；同类型 α 商为 $\\Lambda_A$。$A\\in\\mathrm{Typ}$。$\\to_{\\beta\\eta}^{\\mathrm{Ty}}$ 取 [[56-thm-simply-typed-strong-normalization]]，仅合并 β 与 η 收缩，且在所有应用、抽象上下文下闭合。关系闭包、局部合流、合流与正规形谓词采用相应直接依赖的接口。$M,N\\in\\Lambda_A$；$\\simeq_A$ 是下式定义的固定类型转换关系。工作于 ZFC。"},{"id":"724872afe5c644b4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["d547d7414660f6bd"]}